  "passage": "Last summer, I went on an unforgettable trip to Italy with my family. We were excited to explore the country's tourism attractions, from historic cities to coastal villages. Our main goal was to attend a traditional festival in a small town, known for its music and food. The journey started smoothly, but we faced a temporary issue when our train was delayed at the platform. The delay was due to a technical fault, and we had to wait for an hour. During this time, we met some friendly locals who told us about the festival. When we finally arrived, the event was in full swing. We enjoyed the performances and tried various dishes. Unfortunately, my camera was damaged when I dropped it, so I missed capturing some moments. Despite this minor problem, the trip was amazing, and I learned a lot about Italian culture. I hope to return someday for another adventure.",
